WEBVTT

00:05:30.409 --> 00:05:34.372
That potential lies
in local communities around the world,

00:05:34.372 --> 00:05:37.541
so let’s invest in our indigenous history.

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:40.419
That history is full of wisdom,

00:05:40.419 --> 00:05:41.420
and who knows,

00:05:41.420 --> 00:05:43.255
it may also be delicious.

00:05:43.631 --> 00:05:44.632
Cheers.